WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:43.270
Alchemy

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:43.270
Shower

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.390
Yul from the So family

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.680
Don't come back here

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.480
Will you come again -

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.530
I'll kill you

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:26.820
Wait...

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.690
I couldn't stop her

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.940
Couldn't ask why

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:03.440
When she cut my sincerity into pieces

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.530
I stopped cherishing our memories

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.450
Everything became a secret that I had to keep in my heart

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.210
You got up early. What are you doing here?

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:26.800
Why are you

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.260
came here?

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:34.350
Catch the bird. I'll prepare it for you

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:38.730
Food doesn't bring me joy

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:40.770
I'll cook rice with chestnuts

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.150
The chestnuts here are very sweet

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.390
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:50.820
Danhyangok has very sweet chestnuts

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.390
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.390
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Zero_Amamiya

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.460
And I don't like sweets either

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:11.010
You could just refuse

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.470
Given your strength, I could have died

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.430
Don't overact

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:21.730
I pushed you, but I didn't intend to kill you

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.400
But they pushed

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:25.940
No need to bother with breakfast

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.490
I'll leave when Dan Gu wakes up

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:30.110
You don't want it, as you want it

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.130
Why are you still here?

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.260
I'll eat before I leave

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:52.930
Prepare to eat

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.640
I thought you didn't want

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.520
I didn't say that. Don't slander

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:04.560
You drank too much yesterday, I thought you would feel bad in the morning

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.190
I refused so as not to bother you

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:09.490
Got it

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.450
Then

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:14.120
- I need to wash more rice
- Where is he?

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.490
- I'll wash it
-Have you cooked rice before?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.870
No, but I can if you teach me

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.420
It's very simple

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:27.550
Rinse the rice in water, add enough water

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:29.090
and cook over high heat

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.090
And then let it stand

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:35.140
Pretty simple

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.310
You said you could if I explained

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.110
You said it yourself, it's easy

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:52.740
I was wrong. I'm sorry

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.950
Look at this

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.620
He's all burnt

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.500
Let me make amends

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.620
And those vegetables

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.130
Teach how to cut vegetables

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.720
- Now just throw it away
- Wow

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.930
Dan Gu

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:22.930
Hey

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.190
Take a swim before you leave

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.150
Mineral water will make your skin softer

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.820
And have breakfast

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.230
Exactly

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.440
Moo Deok and Yul prepare breakfast together

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.740
- Together?
- Yes

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:37.120
Yul cooks rice with Moo Deok

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.170
I told you to cut the onion into large pieces

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.260
- Are these large ones?
- No

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.470
You don't know the meaning of the word "large"?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.140
Large pieces

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:08.270
Large...

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.650
Not the same

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.440
These are also small

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:14.150
Like this

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:18.160
Large pieces. Like this

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.290
I should have explained it properly

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.290
How was I supposed to understand your "big pieces"?

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.710
I thought you were the best magician of Jeongjingak

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.250
Can't tell big from small?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.380
Forget it

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.880
Pour water in a bowl

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.680
Wait...

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.440
What bowl are you talking about?

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.480
This one?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.070
Or this one?

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:56.700
This?

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.740
Here

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:09.830
Why does it seem like Moo Deok is scolding him?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.090
Are you sure she likes him?

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:13.630
This is the type of girl

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:17.840
She doesn't show affection or embarrassment in front of others

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:24.310
Just look at Yulia

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:27.810
They scold him, but he still studies

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.310
- Studying?
- Look

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.820
She said it's enough

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.650
I don't like salty food

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.660
He was never like this

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:45.660
- Try it yourself
-Even in front of Master Huo or my uncle

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:46.950
funny

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.460
He's like a scared student, isn't he?

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:51.920
Fresh, right?

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.750
Here. I should have stopped when I said

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.260
- I'm sorry
- Dear master and his obedient student

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:02.680
Leave it. Need to finish cooking

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.890
- Master and student?
- Sit down

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:07.270
Why are you so stubborn

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.480
if you are cooking for the first time?

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:17.610
OK

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:21.320
Let's see how you taught him and how you learned

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.410
Let's try

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.080
Delicious

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.460
Is it delicious?

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.090
I did everything as Moo Deok said

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.260
Well done

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:44.140
Delighted, I suppose, after the teacher’s praise

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:48.010
I thought I was good at everything because people call me a genius

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.980
But it turns out there is something I can't do

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:52.020
Moo Deok,

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:53.730
thank you for helping me realize this

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.980
It wasn't easy because he didn't understand what I was saying

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.740
But he still continued to try

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.070
So I continued to teach him

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.990
You're exaggerating

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.910
It’s as if a royal table has been set here

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.790
You can learn a lot while cooking

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:13.460
- You should learn too
- Alas,

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.250
I don't have a teacher like him

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.170
Sorry, but the rice is a little burnt

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.920
- Yes
- You can try again

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:26.470
Moo Deok, do you think he will do better next time?

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:29.100
He's not completely hopeless

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:30.850
Thank you for such words

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:47.240
Why do you wash it yourself?

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.450
Ask your amazing student to help

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:53.250
He made some food, so I'll clean it up

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.170
Was it a pleasure to teach him?

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:58.040
Do you want him

00:09:58.710 --> 00:09:59.790
was your student?

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.880
It would be easier if it were like this

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.550
He is diligent, obedient

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.510
Not lazy and reckless like you

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.100
Teacher, don't cheat on me

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:12.520
What?

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.890
I understand that you like his diligence and perseverance

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:17.310
But I'm your only student

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.860
A teacher should not have several students and vice versa

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:24.150
Upset because I taught Yulia how to cook?

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.150
Yes. Exactly. How could you teach someone else

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:28.280
when your student was right in front of you?

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.030
Do you want to teach someone how to cook? Let it be me

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.740
Teaching someone else is betrayal and treason

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:36.540
I understand the part about betrayal

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.830
But betrayal?

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.380
There are no words

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.550
I'm sure

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.470
that I felt betrayed

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:55.020
What else is this?

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:56.980
Well, what else?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:58.810
Moo Deok, don't cheat on me

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.310
It hurts and angers me

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:03.190
I didn't know my student was so obsessed

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.780
Okay, you'll be the only one

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.950
a student who talks nonsense in the morning. Are you satisfied?

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.660
- But...
- Moo Dok!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:12.660
Moo Dok!

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:15.160
owner,

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:19.580
it's treason if I call others masters

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.540
and answer their call?

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.380
Of course, there's nothing you can do about it

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.960
But when you call them,

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:28.470
call me masters

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:31.590
Laughter and nothing more

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:37.600
Master Pak, I'm coming!

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.730
Moo Deok, you hurt my feelings. I told you to call me master!

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.160
Very high

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.620
Yul, did you want to see this tree?

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:58.200
Like

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.670
I can't believe it exists

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:12.760
How did you know I was hurt?

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:16.260
There's a tall tree nearby,

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:21.390
From the top you can see the whole of Danhyangok

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.780
From the top you can see all of Danhyangok

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.240
So you climbed

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.660
to the very top?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.630
I assumed so since it is high

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.670
Do you want to go up?

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.420
Shall I help you climb?

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:53.720
Dan Gu, you won't be able to climb it

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:57.140
You need to at least master Chisa in order to climb there

00:12:58.390 --> 00:12:59.390
Yes?

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.520
Maybe I should try?

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.100
Exactly

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.100
Maybe you can do it

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:06.980
Moo Deok, go with him

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:11.780
Do you want to climb?

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.370
I don't want to

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:21.580
I don't want to climb this tree with just anyone.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.340
"With just anyone"?

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.720
I think she's too afraid

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.130
Let's go

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:48.520
I studied the core of his energy

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.570
He was a commoner, not a magician

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:56.740
I'm sure there are many more victims

00:13:56.820 --> 00:14:00.200
Among us is a nomad

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.700
What should I do, Master Li?

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:05.620
Recognizing the origin of this magic is more difficult,

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.210
how to catch a nomad

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.590
I suspect Jeonbugwan

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:14.420
This nomad who invaded Sosnovy Bor

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.300
there were stargazers there

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:21.060
Moreover, it was Jin Mu

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:23.020
destroyed Nak Su during the soul transfer,

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:25.730
and then all her people

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:28.900
Nak Su...

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.620
We found out who he was

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:39.820
And who?

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:42.290
One of Jeonbugwan's servants

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:45.830
What? Jeonbugwan is involved again

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.580
I'll go see Jin Mu now!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.250
Everything is behind me

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.540
Yeom

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:53.170
Yes?

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:54.960
Don't do anything

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.970
At one time, your recklessness ruined a lot

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.140
Now you've grown up, but your character is still the same

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.720
Sorry teacher

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:06.430
It's not time yet

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:10.480
We need to keep a close eye on Jeonbugwan

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:11.860
Jin

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.400
You grew up smart

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.820
You were running around in your underpants

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:21.160
I can't believe you grew up like that and lead people

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.040
teacher

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.920
Who is he?

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:37.590
He was a student

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:41.550
master So Gyong, founder of Sosnovy Bor

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.060
But he's so young

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:46.520
Not at all

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:49.100
I still remember singing

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.190
at a celebration in honor of his centenary

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.320
I even danced

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.950
This dog... is it Gwigu?

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:11.620
So it was you who took Gwiga from Jinyeowon

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.960
He will find a nomad

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.210
Nak Soo died during the soul transfer, right?

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.130
Yes

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.680
She was a famous mercenary and talented magician

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.600
Was it not her soul that I felt?

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:42.450
Chang Gan's sword now

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.700
- his son, right?
- Yes

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:48.620
Have you met him?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.580
I saw a young man with a bracelet

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.830
and the maid who followed him

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:56.880
Interesting

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:06.510
Moo Deok picked some chestnuts

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:09.220
They are sweet, yes. Give Kim the maid some too

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.180
Of course

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.740
Why did you take your father's sword?

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:23.610
Eh, this? Moo Deok took it

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.780
You're not going to train, why did you bring it here?

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:28.910
Should I take it to maid Kim?

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:31.700
You...

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.040
not son

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.540
Chan Gan

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.170
As you wish

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.550
- Let's go
- Yes

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:51.890
You said that you often collected herbs here

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:57.100
Have you seen anyone who lived here?

00:17:57.190 --> 00:18:00.190
No. Who would even live here?

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.820
I see

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.740
And one more thing

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.910
Is it very cold in winter?

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.790
And what?

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:19.670
I've never been here in winter

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.670
I worried every time it snowed

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.260
I was worried if it was too cold

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:32.100
Is everything okay

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:44.110
It gets warmer here

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:47.200
than it may seem

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:53.290
Snow melts quickly in sunny places

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.170
Yes? I'm glad

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:06.720
Yes, there is plenty of food here even in winter

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.340
There is somewhere to hide from the snow

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:15.600
- I'm sure it's delicious
- Very

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:19.980
Should we stay another day?

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.900
Apparently Moo Deok really likes him

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.200
He told her

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:32.660
don't like it

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:35.240
I tell you you like it!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:36.870
Look

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:41.040
She doesn't look at us the same way she looks at him.

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:51.180
The wind blows

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:01.560
Does it come from her?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.280
Dan Gu, let's go

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:07.990
Yes

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:14.030
Bye, Moo Deok

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.540
Let's go

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.470
I'll see them off

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:44.400
- Have a nice trip
- See you later

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.530
Try to remember where you lost the spirit amulet

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:50.190
- Okay
- And keep your head down

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.860
Because of you, even the Unified Council was convened

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:55.870
I think all 12 of my former teachers were there.

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:58.790
They were all so heartless towards you

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:02.330
They even offered to seal away all your energy

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:05.330
- Why would they say that?
- What?

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:09.590
Because you ran away from the fight

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:13.050
But that's just stupid

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:14.970
You didn't want it to happen either

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:17.260
Nobody expects you to show up

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:21.020
So just stay here and live quietly

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.100
The head wanted to know something

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:28.730
He asked if you were doing what you were told

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:31.990
You

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.530
the fruit of your mother's betrayal

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:38.160
But we can't let you become the head of Jeonbugwan.

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:41.410
So stop dreaming of following in the footsteps

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.750
his father

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:48.380
Remain a clueless heir

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.470
Chan family

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:58.180
Can I give him a positive answer?

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:00.180
Have I ever been obedient?

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:03.680
Tell him I'm doing the exact opposite, being reckless

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:08.110
Dan Gu, leave the sword here

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:10.020
Why?

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:13.190
I want to help Moo Deok catch a pheasant

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:18.820
Bye

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:26.870
Did we hurt his pride?

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:27.830
Leave him

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:30.420
We can't ask him to come back and die there with dignity.

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:40.720
Are you returning with the sword that you gave away?

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:45.270
I've become a laughing stock and it hurts my pride

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:50.150
In that case, let's train like our lives depend on it

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:52.610
It seems like you're having fun

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:56.110
that your student has become a laughing stock

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:59.320
Moreover, I will add

00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:03.870
Your friends didn't ask you to come home with them

00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:06.710
If they were you they would fight to the death

00:23:06.790 --> 00:23:09.710
And you were told to run and hide

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:11.920
Do you know why?

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.970
Because you're useless

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:20.850
Your tongue is sharper than a sword

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:24.720
That's how words hurt. Ruthlessly

00:23:24.810 --> 00:23:27.060
I would not hesitate to stab you with a sword,

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:29.140
if it would get you back on track

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:30.270
Yes, master

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:32.610
Beat your useless student to death

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:37.360
Why didn’t you perk up after my words?

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:38.740
Why so broken?

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:43.450
Your evil words upset me in the end

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.660
I need to take a bath and relax

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:49.420
Why does he bathe so often?

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:51.000
Worthless and lazy idiot

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:52.420
I hope you get boiled!

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:57.260
Incredible! What kind of teacher says that to his student?

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:06.640
Wook doesn't remember how he lost his spirit amulet?

00:24:07.600 --> 00:24:09.730
Maybe someone sold it after Uk dropped it

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:12.060
This is how the amulet came to them

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:14.110
I heard there is a place that sells such amulets

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:18.110
In that case, try to find out everything

00:24:19.280 --> 00:24:20.570
- Yes
- Yes

00:24:20.650 --> 00:24:21.910
How...

00:24:24.030 --> 00:24:26.330
What's up with Uka?

00:24:28.950 --> 00:24:31.500
He is doing well, he is fed and healthy

00:24:32.580 --> 00:24:34.710
He still hasn't gotten rid of the bracelet

00:24:37.050 --> 00:24:38.130
You can go

00:24:59.400 --> 00:25:00.860
It's not so heavy anymore

00:25:00.950 --> 00:25:02.490
And it doesn’t interfere with walking

00:25:02.570 --> 00:25:05.160
Some magicians train with iron weights,

00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:07.280
to strengthen your hands and wield a sword better

00:25:07.790 --> 00:25:10.960
You unknowingly became stronger

00:25:11.040 --> 00:25:13.250
while wearing this heavy bracelet all day long

00:25:13.330 --> 00:25:14.750
Unintentionally

00:25:14.830 --> 00:25:17.130
but you found a great training tool for yourself

00:25:18.420 --> 00:25:19.960
You are incredibly lucky

00:25:20.050 --> 00:25:23.430
If I take it off I'll be faster and stronger

00:25:24.010 --> 00:25:27.470
But if you don't learn to control yourself, you'll become even more pathetic

00:25:29.220 --> 00:25:30.270
I...

00:25:30.930 --> 00:25:31.930
Forget it

00:25:35.850 --> 00:25:38.940
What did you and Yul talk about?

00:25:41.360 --> 00:25:42.860
About Danhyangok

00:25:44.860 --> 00:25:47.870
He asked how it was here in winter

00:25:52.040 --> 00:25:53.910
You met Naxu,

00:25:54.670 --> 00:25:56.330
when was you young?

00:25:58.290 --> 00:26:01.340
I wasn't sure when I saw her body

00:26:01.420 --> 00:26:03.970
But a trip to Danhyangok helped me confirm this

00:26:04.050 --> 00:26:05.130
That's why I'm only saying this now

00:26:06.220 --> 00:26:10.010
Danhyangok - deep and dangerous valley

00:26:10.100 --> 00:26:12.770
The little girl couldn't have survived there without anyone's help.

00:26:12.850 --> 00:26:15.560
She lived there as if hiding from someone

00:26:16.980 --> 00:26:19.360
When she found out who I was and what family I was from,

00:26:20.110 --> 00:26:22.030
I never saw her again

00:26:23.240 --> 00:26:25.700
So I found out your name...

00:26:26.490 --> 00:26:29.580
Tell me everything you know about her

00:26:32.370 --> 00:26:33.750
I don't know anything

00:26:34.370 --> 00:26:36.120
No name, no age

00:26:36.790 --> 00:26:38.670
Except for the cliff where we watched the birds...

00:26:38.750 --> 00:26:40.420
I've never seen where she lives

00:26:44.550 --> 00:26:45.510
Only one thing

00:26:48.430 --> 00:26:50.350
One day she mentioned her father

00:27:01.400 --> 00:27:05.150
My father described the stars

00:27:07.070 --> 00:27:09.490
I didn't think much of it then

00:27:09.570 --> 00:27:12.200
But that's what stargazers do

00:27:12.280 --> 00:27:13.870
from Jeonbugwan

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:16.370
Master,

00:27:16.870 --> 00:27:18.920
among the stargazer magicians

00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:21.920
was someone angry with you?

00:27:24.920 --> 00:27:26.220
Stargazer

00:27:27.550 --> 00:27:28.880
from Jeonbugwan?

00:27:30.890 --> 00:27:31.970
Mage?

00:27:36.810 --> 00:27:40.480
Twenty years ago there was an astrologer who died...

00:27:41.110 --> 00:27:43.820
at the hands of four families

00:27:45.690 --> 00:27:48.990
His entire family was killed that day

00:27:49.660 --> 00:27:51.070
Except one person

00:27:51.160 --> 00:27:53.950
His daughter was not found that night

00:28:20.350 --> 00:28:22.230
It turns out that our family was guilty

00:28:23.190 --> 00:28:25.110
in the death of her father

00:28:25.690 --> 00:28:27.400
She must have had a grudge against you

00:28:27.480 --> 00:28:29.820
since your family took part in this

00:28:29.900 --> 00:28:32.820
Do you remember anything else?

00:28:33.410 --> 00:28:35.080
It was so long ago

00:28:36.120 --> 00:28:37.830
It's unlikely that I can remember anything else

00:29:00.810 --> 00:29:02.520
Because I wanted to see them

00:29:03.810 --> 00:29:06.020
The broken leg didn't bother me

00:29:06.110 --> 00:29:07.900
And I wasn't afraid that they would scold me

00:29:12.320 --> 00:29:14.160
I loved them very much

00:29:23.370 --> 00:29:27.500
I saw you use it to call your bird

00:29:29.420 --> 00:29:30.670
I want to try too

00:29:31.670 --> 00:29:33.590
Can I take it?

00:30:29.480 --> 00:30:31.110
The Crown Prince is strong

00:30:31.730 --> 00:30:36.150
There's only one way for Uka to defeat him and stay alive.

00:30:37.070 --> 00:30:38.450
Tansu

00:31:12.480 --> 00:31:14.230
What do you want from me?

00:31:15.940 --> 00:31:17.860
Cut the water drops as they fall

00:31:19.280 --> 00:31:20.570
Not a drop of rain

00:31:20.660 --> 00:31:23.040
Even someone as unlucky as you

00:31:23.120 --> 00:31:25.580
will be able to cut the drops that drip so slowly

00:31:26.250 --> 00:31:27.120
Forward

00:31:48.440 --> 00:31:50.310
Just three drops in one sitting

00:31:51.190 --> 00:31:52.360
Doesn't matter

00:31:52.440 --> 00:31:55.980
The tansu you will learn requires you to cut only one

00:31:56.070 --> 00:31:57.190
Tansu?

00:31:58.740 --> 00:31:59.910
Teacher...

00:32:00.410 --> 00:32:03.910
I understand I'm a pretty fast learner

00:32:03.990 --> 00:32:05.330
but Tansu... not too much?

00:32:05.410 --> 00:32:08.000
Looks like your teachers taught you something

00:32:08.080 --> 00:32:09.080
That's right

00:32:09.160 --> 00:32:11.960
You can only learn Tansu after mastering Chisu

00:32:12.630 --> 00:32:14.590
You've barely mastered Ryusu

00:32:14.670 --> 00:32:17.300
Still not in control of your energy

00:32:17.380 --> 00:32:19.220
A student of your level cannot learn this.

00:32:20.550 --> 00:32:21.680
But?

00:32:22.300 --> 00:32:23.640
But that's the only way

00:32:25.310 --> 00:32:29.600
you will defeat the crown prince and stay alive

00:33:04.090 --> 00:33:07.180
Tansu is the movement of energy using a sword

00:33:07.260 --> 00:33:09.060
Your right hand was weak

00:33:09.770 --> 00:33:12.350
but got stronger thanks to the bracelet

00:33:13.480 --> 00:33:14.350
Just one drop

00:33:15.440 --> 00:33:18.440
Hit one drop so that you can collect and direct energy

00:33:30.790 --> 00:33:32.540
You won't be able to master Tansu that quickly.

00:33:33.210 --> 00:33:34.670
Let's eat and continue

00:34:22.840 --> 00:34:24.010
Tansu?

00:34:24.800 --> 00:34:26.590
Yes, he will never be able to master it

00:34:29.300 --> 00:34:32.140
This is not a maid and her master

00:34:32.850 --> 00:34:34.890
Soon teacher and student

00:36:14.160 --> 00:36:15.330
Moo Deok

00:36:17.410 --> 00:36:19.580
So you train him

00:36:22.630 --> 00:36:24.500
I saw him practicing Tansu

00:36:25.380 --> 00:36:26.590
Where did you learn this?

00:36:27.170 --> 00:36:31.180
The owner is smart, he had 12 teachers

00:36:31.260 --> 00:36:33.300
He tries to run without really learning to walk.

00:36:33.390 --> 00:36:35.510
He's got a long way ahead

00:36:35.600 --> 00:36:37.850
It's at least worth a try

00:36:38.430 --> 00:36:41.140
His next move could lead to his death

00:36:45.150 --> 00:36:47.360
Does your master know about this?

00:37:22.730 --> 00:37:24.730
Why didn't you dodge?

00:37:24.810 --> 00:37:25.900
Seriously

00:37:41.750 --> 00:37:44.000
This is the result of you releasing energy outward.

00:37:45.170 --> 00:37:47.210
Your hand might burst if you continue.

00:37:53.380 --> 00:37:56.720
She's about to start rotting. Then you'll have to cut it off

00:37:57.390 --> 00:37:58.510
Really?

00:38:02.680 --> 00:38:05.770
If the decayed energy spreads throughout your body,

00:38:06.400 --> 00:38:07.650
you will die

00:38:27.380 --> 00:38:29.630
The fever subsided. Are you okay

00:38:29.710 --> 00:38:31.340
Sleep. Sleep is the best medicine

00:38:32.130 --> 00:38:33.130
Liar

00:38:35.300 --> 00:38:37.090
Is it true what he said?

00:38:37.640 --> 00:38:39.470
It doesn't matter if I die from poison

00:38:39.550 --> 00:38:42.350
a spanking, a blow from a sword, or having your arm burst

00:38:43.060 --> 00:38:46.440
My teacher doesn't care about his student

00:38:48.020 --> 00:38:49.440
That's right

00:38:50.360 --> 00:38:54.360
This is because you are very lucky and lucky

00:38:55.110 --> 00:38:57.450
Is lying your middle name?

00:39:00.620 --> 00:39:02.700
I just don't want to scare you

00:39:03.290 --> 00:39:06.460
I see. Thank you my merciless teacher

00:39:06.540 --> 00:39:09.130
But stay away when I hold the sword again

00:39:09.210 --> 00:39:10.790
I almost stabbed you today

00:39:10.880 --> 00:39:14.260
I stood because I wanted you to control the energy yourself

00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:16.170
I didn't mean to interfere

00:39:16.260 --> 00:39:19.010
You didn't interfere. I was just worried about you

00:39:25.640 --> 00:39:27.690
Think of me as a mother bird who is worried...

00:39:27.770 --> 00:39:29.810
that her balls would break. Can you imagine?

00:39:29.900 --> 00:39:32.440
Doesn't matter. This would hardly harm me

00:39:32.520 --> 00:39:33.650
I could have dodged

00:39:34.400 --> 00:39:35.610
Wasn't it dangerous?

00:39:35.690 --> 00:39:37.900
How could you dodge if I was so fast?

00:39:37.990 --> 00:39:39.660
Not so fast

00:39:40.320 --> 00:39:41.700
Scoundrel...

00:39:43.540 --> 00:39:45.120
Fast, right? Don't dodge

00:39:45.200 --> 00:39:46.700
You attacked without warning!

00:39:46.790 --> 00:39:48.540
Yes? Then here it is

00:39:48.620 --> 00:39:49.710
Moo Deok eyes

00:39:52.340 --> 00:39:53.380
Bastard

00:39:53.460 --> 00:39:55.460
You bought it again, I can't believe it

00:40:00.430 --> 00:40:01.680
Let's go again

00:40:02.720 --> 00:40:04.180
From this distance?

00:40:04.260 --> 00:40:05.850
- Seriously?
- Let's

00:40:10.560 --> 00:40:11.690
Moo Deok,

00:40:12.940 --> 00:40:15.110
the blue mark is visible in the eyes

00:40:15.980 --> 00:40:17.320
And it's very beautiful

00:40:21.200 --> 00:40:24.780
You better not provoke me by being so close

00:40:25.450 --> 00:40:26.740
Think that I can

00:40:26.830 --> 00:40:28.250
from this distance

00:40:32.500 --> 00:40:34.500
I think you understood my words correctly

00:40:35.380 --> 00:40:37.510
Maybe there's something I can teach you

00:40:41.970 --> 00:40:43.140
Chan Wook

00:40:46.390 --> 00:40:50.100
Do you think I'm naive if I lived here alone?

00:40:51.520 --> 00:40:52.810
Well, yes

00:40:54.770 --> 00:40:57.780
I want you to know that I have a lot to teach you.

00:40:58.990 --> 00:41:00.110
For example?

00:41:07.240 --> 00:41:08.540
Hey! You...

00:41:08.620 --> 00:41:10.790
The attacks that are truly effective are

00:41:10.870 --> 00:41:14.000
when the enemy doesn't expect it at all

00:41:14.540 --> 00:41:16.380
Remember this, my student

00:41:17.590 --> 00:41:21.050
I barely touched you, and you gave me all my might!

00:41:21.130 --> 00:41:22.760
Moo Deok

00:41:24.430 --> 00:41:26.760
Hey Moo Deok

00:41:36.980 --> 00:41:38.780
New concubine?

00:41:39.610 --> 00:41:42.700
Now he doesn't even follow formalities

00:41:43.320 --> 00:41:45.570
She's from a small family of magicians in the east

00:41:45.660 --> 00:41:48.910
On her birthday, a comet streaked past the Big Dipper.

00:41:48.990 --> 00:41:52.710
So he will gather all the women born on unusual nights

00:41:52.790 --> 00:41:55.420
He wants to catch the King's star

00:42:06.430 --> 00:42:08.350
When the late king ascended the throne,

00:42:08.430 --> 00:42:12.640
it was predicted that the next one would be born under the star of the King

00:42:13.770 --> 00:42:16.520
Daeho's people rejoiced

00:42:16.600 --> 00:42:17.480
But

00:42:17.560 --> 00:42:20.690
the throne was taken by your father, born on an ordinary night

00:42:20.780 --> 00:42:22.570
In other respects, just like you

00:42:23.360 --> 00:42:24.900
So the talk started

00:42:25.780 --> 00:42:27.620
The prediction is wrong

00:42:27.700 --> 00:42:31.410
Gwangju Chang Gang escaped after making such a funny prediction

00:42:31.490 --> 00:42:33.540
Your father believes in him

00:42:34.120 --> 00:42:35.870
That's why you're afraid

00:42:38.330 --> 00:42:39.790
I'm not afraid

00:42:39.880 --> 00:42:42.670
Are you afraid that someone with that kind of energy will come along?

00:42:42.760 --> 00:42:44.920
or that your father will have a son

00:42:45.800 --> 00:42:47.640
I know that

00:42:51.060 --> 00:42:53.810
Your fight with Chan Wook is just around the corner

00:42:53.890 --> 00:42:57.230
Destroy the son of the one who made this prediction

00:42:58.860 --> 00:43:01.650
Get rid of your fears now that you have the chance

00:43:04.280 --> 00:43:05.450
Do you think

00:43:06.320 --> 00:43:07.780
will he appear?

00:43:08.780 --> 00:43:09.870
I heard he was running

00:43:10.780 --> 00:43:14.250
There are rumors that he is even ready to get married, just not to fight

00:43:15.410 --> 00:43:16.710
Marriage?

00:43:16.790 --> 00:43:20.710
I heard he will join the Jin family to use their family amulet

00:43:27.130 --> 00:43:29.140
Are Wook and Jo Young getting married?

00:43:29.930 --> 00:43:31.760
They broke off their engagement once

00:43:32.680 --> 00:43:34.640
Therefore, it is easier to prepare for the wedding

00:43:35.430 --> 00:43:38.640
She still has wedding gifts

00:43:38.730 --> 00:43:40.900
since last time

00:43:43.940 --> 00:43:45.030
I see

00:43:45.530 --> 00:43:48.400
After Chan Wook's wedding...

00:43:48.490 --> 00:43:51.450
That is, my husband will move here

00:43:51.950 --> 00:43:54.450
But my room is too small for the two of us

00:43:54.540 --> 00:43:59.000
Can we use the large room in the east wing?

00:43:59.580 --> 00:44:02.340
This is your sister's room

00:44:03.840 --> 00:44:06.380
This is our best room

00:44:06.460 --> 00:44:09.510
It's such a shame to keep it empty for so many years.

00:44:10.510 --> 00:44:11.970
It's not empty

00:44:12.680 --> 00:44:14.390
Boo Young will be back

00:44:15.810 --> 00:44:17.560
Sorry, mother

00:44:20.310 --> 00:44:22.190
Your father is looking for her

00:44:23.360 --> 00:44:26.440
Your sister will be coming home soon

00:44:28.860 --> 00:44:31.240
Bring me the jade Yin-and-Yang from Jinyeowon

00:44:33.660 --> 00:44:34.950
Yin and Yang?

00:44:35.030 --> 00:44:36.410
You wanted him

00:44:37.950 --> 00:44:41.000
They say that if a couple wears rings made of such jade,

00:44:41.080 --> 00:44:42.790
love will only grow stronger

00:44:44.920 --> 00:44:47.920
Let them make rings from it

00:44:49.340 --> 00:44:51.090
Thank you mom

00:45:14.620 --> 00:45:16.990
Annoying trash can. Is that you?

00:45:17.490 --> 00:45:19.040
You're annoying

00:45:26.000 --> 00:45:27.250
I think you're angry

00:45:27.340 --> 00:45:29.420
that I'm getting married

00:45:29.510 --> 00:45:30.550
You'll see

00:45:30.630 --> 00:45:32.220
You'll get angrier

00:45:32.300 --> 00:45:34.050
when will I put on this jade ring?

00:45:46.360 --> 00:45:47.940
Eat

00:45:48.940 --> 00:45:50.230
Yes

00:45:52.610 --> 00:45:55.110
I brought pheasant

00:45:55.200 --> 00:45:57.160
Why is there only greenery here?

00:45:57.240 --> 00:45:58.660
He's there...

00:45:59.330 --> 00:46:00.240
He's in the soup

00:46:00.330 --> 00:46:02.080
The pheasant was so small

00:46:02.160 --> 00:46:03.920
There was very little left when I prepared the broth

00:46:14.840 --> 00:46:16.930
The taste is very weak

00:46:21.930 --> 00:46:24.730
I heard something while I was selling herbs in Sosnovy Bor

00:46:24.810 --> 00:46:27.190
Two noble families marry children

00:46:27.770 --> 00:46:29.690
And who is it?

00:46:29.770 --> 00:46:32.690
Mrs. Jin's daughter is getting married

00:46:33.400 --> 00:46:36.450
Has Cho Young found herself a groom? Who is he?

00:46:36.530 --> 00:46:38.660
Son of Gwangju Jeonbugwan

00:46:40.950 --> 00:46:42.330
Isn't that you?

00:46:53.260 --> 00:46:56.470
I didn't say I was getting married. What's happening?

00:46:56.550 --> 00:46:58.220
What is maid Kim doing there?

00:46:58.300 --> 00:47:01.060
Hasty marriages happen due to the appearance of a child

00:47:01.140 --> 00:47:02.180
No, no

00:47:02.770 --> 00:47:04.350
You were already engaged

00:47:05.020 --> 00:47:06.600
Maybe you couldn't help yourself

00:47:06.690 --> 00:47:09.900
We were never that close, how could she get pregnant?

00:47:10.730 --> 00:47:12.860
Well, yes, you’re just so good at talking

00:47:12.940 --> 00:47:14.110
What?

00:47:14.190 --> 00:47:16.070
Then why did you refuse to drink chastity tea?

00:47:16.150 --> 00:47:17.150
This is because...

00:47:19.570 --> 00:47:21.240
that you need to get married

00:47:23.080 --> 00:47:24.830
So I want to get married

00:47:26.120 --> 00:47:27.670
Yes, I want to

00:47:27.750 --> 00:47:28.870
I really want to

00:47:29.630 --> 00:47:32.170
I'll definitely get married

00:47:32.250 --> 00:47:33.500
You'll see

00:47:48.730 --> 00:47:50.440
Why did you want to see me?

00:47:51.230 --> 00:47:54.650
When will the mother-of-pearl cabinet that I ordered from Sosnovy Bor arrive?

00:47:55.280 --> 00:47:56.530
He is for Uk and me

00:47:56.610 --> 00:48:00.610
Goods from the south will arrive in a day of the week

00:48:01.370 --> 00:48:02.660
It's late

00:48:03.660 --> 00:48:05.120
I should have ordered earlier

00:48:05.200 --> 00:48:07.080
Forget about the closet

00:48:07.620 --> 00:48:09.540
I should tell Uku

00:48:10.880 --> 00:48:12.210
He doesn't know

00:48:14.300 --> 00:48:16.920
So I wrote him a letter

00:48:17.720 --> 00:48:19.180
Read and share your thoughts

00:48:20.890 --> 00:48:22.010
Okay

00:48:25.720 --> 00:48:26.850
It smells

00:48:26.930 --> 00:48:29.230
This is the incense that carries love

00:48:30.140 --> 00:48:31.600
Jinyoewon's Treasure

00:48:33.360 --> 00:48:35.980
Smells very nice

00:48:57.800 --> 00:48:59.550
Why are you smelling it?

00:48:59.630 --> 00:49:00.590
Stop it!

00:49:01.720 --> 00:49:03.640
And close your nose!

00:49:15.980 --> 00:49:17.820
Almost spent it all for nothing

00:49:21.030 --> 00:49:22.740
Give the letter to Uku

00:49:23.320 --> 00:49:26.530
And make sure there's no woman around when he opens

00:49:29.330 --> 00:49:30.160
Okay

00:49:35.500 --> 00:49:36.630
What are you doing?

00:49:36.710 --> 00:49:41.380
You and Uk have the same hands, right?

00:49:43.380 --> 00:49:44.590
And what?

00:49:45.390 --> 00:49:47.890
Come with me to buy wedding rings

00:49:47.970 --> 00:49:49.310
Lend me your hand

00:49:50.060 --> 00:49:52.520
Why should I go there with you?

00:49:52.600 --> 00:49:53.770
Go with your fiance

00:49:54.810 --> 00:49:58.940
Marriage must be concluded by mutual consent

00:49:59.570 --> 00:50:02.320
It's sad that you act like this

00:50:03.610 --> 00:50:04.450
Why?

00:50:06.030 --> 00:50:07.990
Do you think I'm rushing things?

00:50:08.700 --> 00:50:10.740
Or that he will refuse again?

00:50:15.710 --> 00:50:18.420
Are you in a hurry or not?

00:50:19.960 --> 00:50:21.380
I'll help

00:50:22.210 --> 00:50:23.380
If only it worked

00:50:28.430 --> 00:50:30.180
I'll lend my hand too

00:50:39.360 --> 00:50:40.940
If you think so,

00:50:41.030 --> 00:50:43.650
maid Kim was against me living with my wife's family,

00:50:43.740 --> 00:50:45.820
when was the last time we discussed marriage with Cho Young

00:50:47.200 --> 00:50:50.490
There is only one reason why marriage is being talked about again

00:50:50.990 --> 00:50:52.200
My defense

00:50:52.790 --> 00:50:55.040
She made a deal with the Jin family,

00:50:55.120 --> 00:50:57.460
to help you avoid a fight

00:50:57.540 --> 00:50:59.540
She probably needed Madam Jin's influence

00:51:01.000 --> 00:51:02.630
In that case,

00:51:03.670 --> 00:51:05.090
are you getting married?

00:51:06.840 --> 00:51:09.850
What should I do, teacher? Marry?

00:51:12.220 --> 00:51:13.350
Costs?

00:51:15.180 --> 00:51:18.900
In that case, there's no reason to stay here any longer.

00:51:19.480 --> 00:51:21.400
Exactly. We need to return home

00:51:21.480 --> 00:51:23.690
But our relationship, of course, will not last

00:51:23.780 --> 00:51:26.650
Why? You can still be my maid

00:51:28.860 --> 00:51:31.530
It's not my plan to be her forever

00:51:49.760 --> 00:51:51.390
Then you will swim on your own

00:51:51.470 --> 00:51:52.970
I'll be in Jwiseonru

00:51:54.310 --> 00:51:57.390
If you don't come for me, I'll leave alone

00:52:12.120 --> 00:52:13.870
Chwiseonru

00:52:19.330 --> 00:52:20.330
What is it?

00:52:20.420 --> 00:52:22.080
We are from Jeonbugwan

00:52:22.170 --> 00:52:24.040
We'll take you there

00:52:24.130 --> 00:52:24.960
Let's go

00:52:28.380 --> 00:52:30.300
This is His Highness's sachet

00:52:30.380 --> 00:52:34.050
I am under the protection of the prince himself, you dare not touch me

00:52:37.270 --> 00:52:39.730
What are you doing? Let go!

00:52:39.810 --> 00:52:41.690
This is the Crown Prince's sachet

00:52:53.700 --> 00:52:55.910
We delivered it from Jwiseonru

00:52:56.540 --> 00:52:58.330
Chwisungru?

00:53:07.130 --> 00:53:09.550
The girl you asked has arrived

00:53:10.170 --> 00:53:11.300
Where is she?

00:53:15.010 --> 00:53:16.100
Here

00:53:18.430 --> 00:53:19.390
She?

00:53:19.930 --> 00:53:21.520
Raise your head

00:53:33.070 --> 00:53:34.700
Why are you dressed like that?

00:53:35.280 --> 00:53:36.780
No idea

00:53:37.320 --> 00:53:40.530
She changed my clothes as soon as they brought me here

00:53:41.490 --> 00:53:43.660
Is this your doing?

00:53:43.750 --> 00:53:45.830
Isn't she a gisaeng...

00:53:46.710 --> 00:53:47.960
from Jwiseonru?

00:53:49.130 --> 00:53:50.290
No

00:53:51.840 --> 00:53:54.260
- She's Won Moo Deok
- S-Stink?

00:53:56.340 --> 00:53:57.590
Get out

00:53:58.510 --> 00:53:59.760
Go

00:54:02.890 --> 00:54:04.140
Just look at yourself

00:54:08.350 --> 00:54:10.360
Why did you want to see me?

00:54:10.440 --> 00:54:14.280
I wanted to say something, so I ordered you to be delivered

00:54:14.360 --> 00:54:16.360
But now you are not Won Moo Deok

00:54:16.450 --> 00:54:18.070
Stink and silk don't go hand in hand

00:54:18.780 --> 00:54:21.370
In your dictionary it is very

00:54:22.410 --> 00:54:23.790
Did you just snap?

00:54:23.870 --> 00:54:25.410
No

00:54:25.500 --> 00:54:28.460
I'm grateful that they dressed me in silk

00:54:30.080 --> 00:54:33.340
Let's say. This new look...

00:54:35.210 --> 00:54:36.590
doesn't suit you

00:54:39.380 --> 00:54:42.850
You don't like it, I'm uncomfortable with it,

00:54:42.930 --> 00:54:44.180
I'll change my clothes

00:54:44.260 --> 00:54:45.350
No

00:54:46.520 --> 00:54:49.100
It doesn't matter. Leave it as is

00:54:51.560 --> 00:54:55.650
Say what you want and I'll do it

00:54:55.730 --> 00:54:58.030
Tell your master...

00:54:58.650 --> 00:54:59.950
don't come that day

00:55:01.110 --> 00:55:02.450
I don't want to kill him

00:55:02.530 --> 00:55:05.700
and become an enemy for Sosnovy Bor and the Chan family

00:55:06.410 --> 00:55:08.710
It will be better if he runs away and leaves everything as it is

00:55:10.250 --> 00:55:12.710
I mean, he just needs to remain a laughing stock

00:55:13.380 --> 00:55:14.420
That's right

00:55:15.050 --> 00:55:18.340
If he gets stubborn, talk him out of it

00:55:18.420 --> 00:55:20.340
He won't survive a fight with me

00:55:22.930 --> 00:55:26.060
Let him sit quietly and then marry Jin Cho Young

00:55:27.350 --> 00:55:30.440
So it's true that marriage will save his life

00:55:33.190 --> 00:55:35.480
What will happen to you if he marries?

00:55:35.570 --> 00:55:36.690
Will you stay with him?

00:55:37.360 --> 00:55:38.650
I won't stay

00:55:39.280 --> 00:55:41.950
Why? Did he give up on you?

00:55:44.370 --> 00:55:47.240
And you were ready to drink water from the chamber pot for his sake

00:55:47.330 --> 00:55:49.000
He has no loyalty

00:55:49.080 --> 00:55:50.410
no dignity

00:55:51.620 --> 00:55:55.840
There is something, Your Highness

00:55:55.920 --> 00:55:58.340
Are you protecting him? And usually she said nasty things

00:55:58.420 --> 00:56:00.220
Forgive me

00:56:01.170 --> 00:56:03.470
You would be pleased to hear nasty things about him,

00:56:04.300 --> 00:56:08.060
but now I don't have the strength to talk

00:56:09.600 --> 00:56:12.230
You are a dirty mongrel that will be abandoned by your owner.

00:56:23.570 --> 00:56:24.610
Do you want me to take it with you?

00:56:26.740 --> 00:56:27.990
I can

00:56:28.580 --> 00:56:30.870
You will find a job here too

00:56:32.210 --> 00:56:33.080
I don't want to

00:56:34.500 --> 00:56:37.380
Let me be Won Moo Deok, whom everyone avoids,

00:56:37.960 --> 00:56:40.760
but I don't serve everyone

00:56:44.260 --> 00:56:46.890
Forget it. You didn't give up on me either

00:56:47.510 --> 00:56:49.560
- You can go
- Yes

00:56:55.100 --> 00:56:56.650
Then I'll go

00:56:57.230 --> 00:56:58.480
Your Highness

00:57:08.030 --> 00:57:09.410
"To each and every one"?

00:57:10.740 --> 00:57:12.040
I'm a prince

00:57:12.120 --> 00:57:14.120
Won Moo Deok doesn't understand

00:57:14.210 --> 00:57:15.750
who is he talking to?

00:57:33.230 --> 00:57:35.980
- Be careful. Take your time
- Yes, madam

00:57:38.110 --> 00:57:38.940
Maid Kim

00:57:40.360 --> 00:57:41.230
How are you?

00:57:42.480 --> 00:57:43.570
Young master!

00:57:44.190 --> 00:57:45.700
My dear!

00:57:47.700 --> 00:57:49.570
- Young master!
- Were you worried?

00:57:49.660 --> 00:57:50.870
Did you eat well?

00:57:50.950 --> 00:57:52.580
Yes, okay

00:57:52.660 --> 00:57:54.120
What happiness

00:57:54.200 --> 00:57:55.710
Your skin is glowing

00:57:55.790 --> 00:57:56.920
Come on!

00:57:57.000 --> 00:57:58.290
Let's go inside

00:58:01.960 --> 00:58:03.800
She was trying to sell it

00:58:06.470 --> 00:58:07.840
amulet from Sosnovy Bor?

00:58:15.770 --> 00:58:17.850
It wasn't me. It's all Moo Deok

00:58:18.650 --> 00:58:20.860
Moo Deok tried to sell Wook's amulet?

00:58:20.940 --> 00:58:23.190
I just introduced her to the seller

00:58:23.280 --> 00:58:25.280
In the end, Ah Hyang stole it

00:58:25.360 --> 00:58:27.320
That's why Moo Deok and I have nothing to do with it

00:58:45.050 --> 00:58:46.340
What are you doing?

00:58:47.720 --> 00:58:49.970
Why is she dressed like that?

00:58:50.720 --> 00:58:52.430
Long story

00:58:52.510 --> 00:58:55.270
Have you returned to Jwiseonra?

00:58:56.140 --> 00:58:58.390
Uk sold you back because he's getting married?

00:58:58.480 --> 00:58:59.770
No

00:58:59.850 --> 00:59:03.770
Even if it sells, I won't come back here

00:59:03.860 --> 00:59:05.860
Joo Wol finally gave in and told me,

00:59:05.940 --> 00:59:07.650
that you were trying to sell Uka's amulet

00:59:10.990 --> 00:59:12.820
Yes, I tried

00:59:13.700 --> 00:59:14.620
Why?

00:59:15.740 --> 00:59:17.500
Because I needed money

00:59:17.580 --> 00:59:20.290
I wanted to wear silks, eat sweets,

00:59:20.370 --> 00:59:22.880
and have fun in such places

00:59:22.960 --> 00:59:26.460
That's why you got drunk last time

00:59:27.380 --> 00:59:30.630
Yes. I stole my owner's money and got drunk

00:59:35.220 --> 00:59:37.270
I'm downright puzzled

00:59:38.980 --> 00:59:41.480
I don't understand you at all

00:59:44.900 --> 00:59:47.190
And you don't need to

00:59:47.280 --> 00:59:49.070
Leave everything as it is

00:59:51.150 --> 00:59:52.780
I'm coming in

00:59:52.860 --> 00:59:54.530
Do you want to come with me?

00:59:55.330 --> 00:59:56.240
No

00:59:57.490 --> 00:59:58.620
Goodbye

01:00:11.800 --> 01:00:13.260
Amulet...

01:00:14.640 --> 01:00:17.810
So it's you, Nak Soo

01:00:27.940 --> 01:00:29.070
Mister,

01:00:30.860 --> 01:00:32.860
why don't you want to get married?

01:00:34.700 --> 01:00:36.240
Don't you like Ms. Jin?

01:00:36.320 --> 01:00:38.660
It's not that I don't like her

01:00:39.700 --> 01:00:41.580
I'm just not interested

01:00:42.210 --> 01:00:44.330
Do you like someone else?

01:00:45.710 --> 01:00:46.920
Who?

01:00:47.500 --> 01:00:49.000
Do I know her?

01:00:50.010 --> 01:00:52.050
No, you don't know her

01:00:52.630 --> 01:00:53.840
So there is someone

01:00:53.930 --> 01:00:55.180
I knew it

01:00:55.260 --> 01:00:56.300
Who is she?

01:00:57.850 --> 01:00:58.890
Well...

01:00:58.970 --> 01:01:01.890
She's like a lonely egg in a nest at the top of a tree

01:01:02.520 --> 01:01:06.060
She has no one but me, so how can I marry someone else?

01:01:06.150 --> 01:01:09.070
These girls are the most dangerous!

01:01:09.150 --> 01:01:11.400
They have nothing to brag about, but they will stick tightly!

01:01:11.480 --> 01:01:12.990
She's not like that

01:01:13.070 --> 01:01:15.530
Who is she? Speak

01:01:15.610 --> 01:01:16.910
I'll take care of her

01:01:16.990 --> 01:01:18.160
How exactly?

01:01:18.240 --> 01:01:20.700
I'll give her a bag of money

01:01:20.790 --> 01:01:23.370
she will hatch from the egg and fly away

01:01:23.460 --> 01:01:26.880
She can't fly away, it's not that simple

01:01:28.170 --> 01:01:30.300
Anyway, I can't get married

01:01:30.380 --> 01:01:31.590
Deal with it

01:01:32.550 --> 01:01:34.720
Just figure it out. Fine?

01:01:35.510 --> 01:01:36.840
Mister

01:01:39.350 --> 01:01:42.060
What is it? Are you injured?

01:01:42.140 --> 01:01:43.390
Show me

01:01:45.560 --> 01:01:47.480
What's wrong with the hand?

01:01:49.270 --> 01:01:50.940
Out of control again?

01:01:58.160 --> 01:01:59.780
Sell this dress

01:01:59.870 --> 01:02:03.500
- It’s silk, sell it at a higher price
- Okay

01:02:04.080 --> 01:02:06.540
The lady has a visitor now

01:02:06.620 --> 01:02:08.330
Young Miss Jin from Jinyeowon is here

01:02:09.080 --> 01:02:12.630
She is looking for a master who will make wedding rings for her

01:02:12.710 --> 01:02:14.550
She marries the magician from Sosnovy Bor

01:02:18.510 --> 01:02:20.760
How do you like this ring?

01:02:23.770 --> 01:02:27.480
These are the works of the best artisan from Deho

01:02:29.270 --> 01:02:32.150
They are beautiful, but a little tasteless

01:02:33.780 --> 01:02:36.030
Can I have a look at the yin-yang jade?

01:02:36.110 --> 01:02:38.780
Once I see it for myself, I can choose better options.

01:02:43.620 --> 01:02:45.620
They say when lovers wear jade rings,

01:02:45.700 --> 01:02:48.210
their love grows stronger

01:03:02.430 --> 01:03:04.140
Why did the jade crack?

01:03:04.970 --> 01:03:07.350
When I took it everything was fine

01:03:13.150 --> 01:03:15.860
Did he break then?

01:03:18.860 --> 01:03:19.950
Moo Deok

01:03:26.620 --> 01:03:27.870
Mistress

01:03:28.460 --> 01:03:30.750
Why are you leaving suddenly?

01:03:30.830 --> 01:03:33.920
Is this Moo Deok? Uk is here too?

01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:35.210
No

01:03:36.550 --> 01:03:39.170
- Is that so?
- She follows him with her tail,

01:03:39.260 --> 01:03:41.050
he must be somewhere in the city

01:03:41.130 --> 01:03:42.930
Does it walk with its tail?

01:03:43.010 --> 01:03:44.720
She is his servant!

01:03:45.850 --> 01:03:47.270
Watch your language

01:03:48.730 --> 01:03:52.310
Moo Deok is not just a maid for him

01:03:53.480 --> 01:03:56.940
Moo Deok got drunk recently and he came for her

01:03:57.610 --> 01:03:59.400
He dotes on her

01:03:59.490 --> 01:04:01.990
I carried it on my back

01:04:02.660 --> 01:04:03.570
Surely

01:04:03.660 --> 01:04:07.370
I took it from here because I liked it

01:04:07.910 --> 01:04:11.210
Is Mu Deok from here? Was she a gisaeng?

01:04:11.290 --> 01:04:12.750
She's a poor girl

01:04:13.420 --> 01:04:16.710
No wonder he's fussing over her so much.

01:04:31.060 --> 01:04:32.100
Hey

01:04:32.730 --> 01:04:34.520
You know who I am, right?

01:04:35.900 --> 01:04:38.020
Of course

01:04:38.110 --> 01:04:40.570
You are Young Miss Jin from Jinyeowon

01:04:42.570 --> 01:04:45.700
Soon you'll be calling me mistress

01:04:46.910 --> 01:04:50.580
Because Uk and I are getting married

01:04:52.120 --> 01:04:54.830
Congratulations

01:04:54.920 --> 01:04:58.130
I will be his wife and you will be my maid

01:04:59.550 --> 01:05:01.090
Do something right now

01:05:03.340 --> 01:05:05.050
Take the box

01:05:06.090 --> 01:05:07.720
What is this?

01:05:14.560 --> 01:05:15.850
What's the matter?

01:05:17.020 --> 01:05:18.690
broken stone

01:05:21.280 --> 01:05:23.700
It's a valuable thing

01:05:23.780 --> 01:05:25.910
If it breaks,

01:05:25.990 --> 01:05:28.030
you'll be to blame

01:05:29.160 --> 01:05:31.830
You say that when he's already broken

01:05:32.750 --> 01:05:33.790
Take it and follow me

01:05:35.040 --> 01:05:36.170
Mistress

01:05:36.920 --> 01:05:38.750
Until I serve you

01:05:39.380 --> 01:05:42.090
It's time for me to go to my master. Goodbye

01:05:46.380 --> 01:05:48.930
Is she looking down on me?

01:05:56.690 --> 01:05:59.230
Didn't I imagine it?

01:06:09.820 --> 01:06:12.200
It's better for me not to cross paths with him

01:06:14.330 --> 01:06:16.370
Hey! You!

01:06:18.460 --> 01:06:19.380
Dangerous man

01:06:21.210 --> 01:06:22.670
or is it a vile brat?

01:06:24.260 --> 01:06:25.340
My lady

01:06:26.130 --> 01:06:28.510
Give it to me. I'll carry

01:06:31.720 --> 01:06:32.850
Okay

01:06:32.930 --> 01:06:35.480
Be careful

01:06:40.060 --> 01:06:41.560
Yes it's already broken

01:06:42.150 --> 01:06:44.360
She wants to blame me for this?

01:07:13.260 --> 01:07:15.260
So does this mean the Jin family lives here?

01:07:48.050 --> 01:07:49.510
What are you doing?

01:08:01.770 --> 01:08:02.810
Mother

01:08:24.500 --> 01:08:26.130
You can't just leave

01:08:27.420 --> 01:08:30.800
Swear in front of the portrait of your late mother that you will marry

01:08:30.880 --> 01:08:33.430
This is the only way to protect your father's status

01:08:35.850 --> 01:08:37.180
Maid Kim

01:08:37.260 --> 01:08:38.470
Do you think...

01:08:39.520 --> 01:08:41.640
that he is my father?

01:08:45.190 --> 01:08:46.560
You know...

01:08:47.860 --> 01:08:49.530
who is my real father?

01:08:51.190 --> 01:08:52.860
What are you saying?

01:08:53.780 --> 01:08:55.990
You are the son of Gwangju Chang Gang

01:08:57.910 --> 01:09:00.120
Yes, that's what I believed all my life

01:09:00.200 --> 01:09:02.040
I don't want to deny it now

01:09:02.120 --> 01:09:03.080
So...

01:09:05.170 --> 01:09:07.170
I won't sit idly by

01:09:08.630 --> 01:09:10.000
Don't stop me

01:09:11.130 --> 01:09:12.470
no matter what I do

01:09:20.470 --> 01:09:23.600
Maid Kim, the Jin family sent something

01:09:24.190 --> 01:09:26.520
From Jinyowon? What's the matter?

01:09:26.600 --> 01:09:28.060
Something happened there

01:09:28.940 --> 01:09:32.030
They want Young Master Chan to rush to them

01:10:12.900 --> 01:10:14.190
Have you been looking for me?

01:10:14.280 --> 01:10:15.570
What does this all mean?

01:10:16.150 --> 01:10:18.870
Our family heirloom has disappeared

01:10:19.660 --> 01:10:20.780
And the maid...

01:10:22.120 --> 01:10:24.250
disappeared with her

01:10:31.590 --> 01:10:34.340
That's what he is, Jinyoewon

01:10:42.810 --> 01:10:43.890
Hey

01:10:51.150 --> 01:10:52.650
So it's you

01:10:56.780 --> 01:10:58.360
Long time no see

01:11:28.640 --> 01:11:29.940
You say Moo Deok...

01:11:30.810 --> 01:11:33.480
- disappeared here?
- Yes

01:11:34.070 --> 01:11:35.480
Your maid, Moo Deok,

01:11:36.190 --> 01:11:38.610
stole the yin-yang jade and ran away

01:11:47.570 --> 01:12:04.300
/////////////////////////////////////

01:11:55.820 --> 01:12:12.550
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:12:10.810 --> 01:12:13.100
You were thinking about me, Your Highness,

01:12:12.550 --> 01:12:15.570
Alchemy

01:12:12.550 --> 01:12:15.570
Shower

01:12:13.190 --> 01:12:14.650
that's why I came

01:12:14.730 --> 01:12:17.360
You missed someone you met in Danhyangok.

01:12:17.440 --> 01:12:18.780
Did I miss you?

01:12:18.860 --> 01:12:20.110
There was no such thing

01:12:20.190 --> 01:12:21.450
Open the door

01:12:21.530 --> 01:12:24.490
Open the door to Jinyeowon, where the relics are kept

01:12:24.570 --> 01:12:26.660
You may be possessed by witchcraft and not be able to return

01:12:26.740 --> 01:12:28.490
You're too afraid to even touch them

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:31.250
What was that?

01:12:31.330 --> 01:12:32.920
Bring Chan Wook

01:12:33.000 --> 01:12:35.080
I have to give you up to live

01:12:35.170 --> 01:12:36.130
This is how it should be

01:12:37.340 --> 01:12:39.880
So Moo Deok was Nak Soo

01:12:43.010 --> 01:12:45.260
Fight like your life depends on it
